# Both values below are PUBLIC BY DESIGN for a Supabase SPA:
#  - The project URL identifies the backend and is visible to every client.
#  - The anon/publishable key is meant to be embedded in browser bundles;
#    data protection comes from Row Level Security policies, not key secrecy.
# See supabase/migrations/*.sql for the RLS policies that enforce access.
#
# ⚠️ NEVER add server-side secrets here (e.g. GEMINI_API_KEY). That key lives
# only as a Supabase Edge Function secret:
#   supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=...
